### ALU (Arithmetic Logic Unit)
|
| Opcode: 8-bit
| Format: R-type (all operations, except NOT)
| Format (NOT): R-type (unary)
|

## 1. Unsigned operations

--------------------------------------

# ADD
    ===| Unsigned |===
    Opcode: 0x00
    Syntax: ADD x2, x0, x1
    Operation:
        x2 = x0 + x1

--------------------------------------

# SUB
    ===| Unsigned |===
    Opcode: 0x01
    Syntax: SUB x2, x0, x1
    Operation:
        x2 = x0 - x1

--------------------------------------

# MUL
    ===| Unsigned |===
    Opcode: 0x02
    Syntax: MUL x2, x0, x1
    Operation:
        x2 = x0 * x1

--------------------------------------

# DIV
    ===| Unsigned |===
    Opcode: 0x03
    Syntax: DIV x2, x0, x1
    Operation:
        if (x1 == 0) then
            x2 = 0
        else
            x2 = x0 / x1
        end

--------------------------------------

# AND
    ===| Unsigned |===
    Opcode: 0x04
    Syntax: AND x2, x0, x1
    Operation:
        x2 = x0 & x1

--------------------------------------

# XOR
    ===| Unsigned |===
    Opcode: 0x05
    Syntax: XOR x2, x0, x1
    Operation:
        x2 = x0 ^ x1

--------------------------------------

# NOT
    ===| Unsigned |===
    Opcode: 0x06
    Syntax: NOT x1, x0
    Operation:
        x1 = ~x0

--------------------------------------

# OR
    ===| Unsigned |===
    Opcode: 0x07
    Syntax: OR x2, x0, x1
    Operation:
        x2 = x0 | x1

--------------------------------------

# SHR
    ===| Unsigned |===
    Opcode: 0x08
    Syntax: SHR x2, x0, x1
    Operation:
        x2 = x0 >> x1

--------------------------------------

# SHL
    ===| Unsigned |===
    Opcode: 0x09
    Syntax: SHL x2, x0, x1
    Operation:
        x2 = x0 << x1

--------------------------------------



## 2. Signed operations

--------------------------------------

# IMUL
    ===| Signed |===
    Opcode: 0x0A
    Syntax: IMUL x2, x0, x1
    Operation:
        x2 = x0 * x1

--------------------------------------

# IDIV
    ===| Signed |===
    Opcode: 0x0B
    Syntax: IDIV x2, x0, x1
    Operation:
        if (x1 == 0) then
            x2 = 0
        else
            x2 = x0 / x1
        end

--------------------------------------
